  "lyrics": [
    {
      "section_id": "section_0",
      "type": "intro",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "(Just the two of us, just the two of us)",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "Baby, your dada loves you",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "And I'ma always be here for you",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "(Just the two of us, just the two of us)",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "No matter what happens",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "You're all I got in this world",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "(Just the two of us, just the two of us)",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "I would never give you up for nothin'",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "8",
          "text": "(Just the two of us, just the two of us)",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "9",
          "text": "Nobody in this world is ever gonna keep you from me",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "10",
          "text": "I love you",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_1",
      "type": "verse",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "C'mon Hai-Hai, we goin' to the beach",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "Grab a couple of toys and let Dada strap you in the car seat",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "Oh, where's Mama? She's takin' a little nap in the trunk",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "Oh, that smell? Dada must've runned over a skunk",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "Now, I know what you're thinkin', it's kind of late to go swimmin'",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "But you know your Mama, she's one of those type of women",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "That do crazy things, and if she don't get her way, she'll throw a fit",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "Don't play with Dada's toy knife, honey, let go of it (No)",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "8",
          "text": "And don't look so upset, why you actin' bashful?",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "9",
          "text": "Don't you wanna help Dada build a sandcastle? (Yeah)",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "10",
          "text": "And Mama said she wants to show you how far she can float",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "11",
          "text": "And don't worry about that little boo-boo on her throat",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "12",
          "text": "It's just a little scratch, it don't hurt",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "13",
          "text": "Her was eatin' dinner while you were sweepin'",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "14",
          "text": "And spilled ketchup on her shirt",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "15",
          "text": "Mama's messy, ain't she? We'll let her wash off in the water",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "16",
          "text": "And me and you can play by ourselves, can't we?",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_2",
      "type": "chorus",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "Just the two of us, just the two of us",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "And when we ride",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "Just the two of us, just the two of us",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "Just you and I",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "Just the two of us, just the two of us",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "And when we ride",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "Just the two of us, just the two of us",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "Just you and I (See, honey)",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_3",
      "type": "verse",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "There's a place called Heaven and a place called Hell",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "A place called prison and a place called jail",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "And Dada's probably on his way to all of 'em except one",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "'Cause Mama's got a new husband and a stepson",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "And you don't want a brother, do ya? (Nah)",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "Maybe when you're old enough",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "To understand a little better, I'll explain it to ya",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "But for now, we'll just say Mama was real, real bad",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "8",
          "text": "Was bein' mean to Dad and made him real, real mad",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "9",
          "text": "But I still feel sad that I put her on time out",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "10",
          "text": "Sit back in your chair, honey, quit tryna climb out",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "11",
          "text": "I told you it's okay, Hai-Hai, want a ba-ba?",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "12",
          "text": "Take a night-night? Na-na-boo, goo-goo-ga-ga?",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "13",
          "text": "Her make poo-poo ca-ca? Dada change your didee",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "14",
          "text": "Clean the baby up so her can take a nighty-nighty",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "15",
          "text": "Your dad'll wake her up as soon as we get to the water",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "16",
          "text": "'97 Bonnie and Clyde, me and my daughter",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        }
      ]
    },
